Import the WM held capture contract

Copy spec/sophia-wm-files.md unmodified from signed Sophia contract
ac04e1a7487e9be3a238075e3c624aff93705f2d and record its digest. The WM file
contract adds the held_capture capability: an Overlay presentation may carry a
keyboard output and bindings while modifier keys pass through. This SDK has no
WM client; library sources, wire layouts and the other contract digests are
unchanged.
